set/model loading, calibration and non-generation checks.","r = median batch_seconds/generated_token_count on actual 120-to-128-token outputs of the same worker/model. When absent, explicitly use its all-output weighted rate, a short-output extrapolation.","Positive-length scenario: O + r * sum of actual positive five-dose token lengths at precisely the same model/layer/channel/question/absolute-dose keys; all128: O + r * 128 * formal record count.","Take the slower of two workers for each model, then sum 2B, 4B and 9B in serial; no arbitrary safety multiplier.","Preflight is already measured and is not added to remaining formal runtime. GPU hours describe worker allocation or two-card reservation, not measured GPU busy time."],"limitations":["These are conditional runtime scenarios, not confidence intervals or hard upper bounds; negative outputs may have different lengths and depth/question mix may change observed throughput.","Long-output samples include repeated controls and are not independent; per-token extrapolation also approximates per-prompt overhead. Only five new negative smoke outputs per worker are available, all at middle-layer Q04.","Queueing, failures, transfer/export/archive and reading are excluded and must be reported separately. Reading has not been timed.","This offline helper was added after the scientific freeze; its own hash is recorded here and no frozen file is changed."]}
